### **4. Does Community Health Choice cover therapy in Houston?**

Community Health Choice members may have mental health benefits depending on their specific coverage program and plan.

The best approach is to review your member benefits and use the [Community Health Choice provider directory](https://memberaccount.communityhealthchoice.org/s/find-a-provider?language=en_US&utm_source=chatgpt.com) to identify eligible behavioral health professionals.

